  ⚠ Approve proposal p-0013 and add the channel deploy-hook (webhook)?                                                  
                                                                                                                        
  Yes runs the command shown. It marks the proposal as approved and then adds the channel with the secret parts you     
  entered, the way qhost notify add adds it. The secret parts go to the command on standard input only, never into the  
  command line, and are never kept on the proposal. It refuses and applies nothing if the proposal is not the one you   
  see.                                                                                                                  
    The channel would be added; no channel of this name exists now. The proposal holds no secret parts: you enter them  
    on approving.                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                        
    $ sudo qhost proposal approve p-0013 --fingerprint fp-p-0013 --confirm --output json                                
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
